window.products.push({"id":940011,"name":"JOYIN 2 Pcs - 18 Inch - Valentine's Day Gnome Plush Dolls Decorations,Valentines Gnome Decor,Home Table Gnome Ornaments,Valentines Day Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7jR271dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER VALUE. This set includes 2 pcs Gnome plush dolls. UNIQUE DESIGN. The gnome plush dolls have different designs like flowers and hearts. It has a combination of white and red colors. IDEAL GIFT. Our gnome plush set is the perfect home or room decoration and also a great gift for children or adults, This valentine gnome plus brings good luck to the family this season. PREMIUM QUALITY. Made of high-quality materials. SAFE FOR CHILDREN: non-toxic, non-BPA. Meet US toy standards. Safety test approved. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION. Providing a great shopping experience is our main priority to our customers. Feel free to message us through “contact sellers” if products don't meet your expectations. The celebrations start at JOYIN!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7jR271dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYIN","source_asin":"B09MYJTT6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MYJTT6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MYJTT6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":940012,"name":"Umbra Udry Rack and Microfiber Dish Drying Mat-Space-Saving Lightweight Design Folds Up for Easy Storage, 24 x 18 inches, 2 Pack Standard w, Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V35CsPcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A dish drying rack is a kitchen essential. The problem is they're often big and bulky not to mention a bit of an eye sore. If that wasn't bad enough, they clutter up your kitchen and take up valuable counter space which can be a real problem especially in smaller, confined living spaces. The alternative, is to painstakingly pile your dishes ever so carefully onto a soaking wet dishcloth or an old tea towel. Until now that is. Introducing UDRY by Umbra Toss the tea towel and ditch the dishcloth because UDRY does so much more and it looks good while doing it! UDRY's patented design combines a durable, molded plastic (BPA-free) dish drying rack (dishwasher safe) together with a lightweight, super-absorbent microfiber dish drying mat (machine washable). The result is an easy to use, easy to clean, all-in-one dish drying solution that you're going to love! Unlike a traditional dish drainer rack that sticks out like a sore thumb and devours precious counter space, UDRY features a low-profile, space-saving design that won't get in your way. In fact, you'll barely notice it unless of course it's stacked with freshly washed dishes. But do not let it's sleek appearance fool you, UDRY holds a surprisingly large assortment of dishes, glassware, cutlery, pots, pans and more. UDRY is available in 2 stylish neutral colors so it will look great in your kitchen regardless of your design style or decor (Modern, Contemporary, Country, Cottage, Coastal, Traditional, Mediterranean and more). And with 2 practical sizes to choose from, UDRY (24 x 18 inches) and UDRY MINI (20 x 13 inches) are the perfect addition to your kitchen regardless of whether It's big or small - It's even great for mobile homes, motorhomes, campers, RVs and other confined living areas where space is at a premium. Here's the best part. When not in use, your UDRY folds up neat and compact so you can tuck it away in a drawer or cupboard leaving your counter-top completely clutter-free. Try doing that with a traditional dish drying rack. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, functional, and affordable design for the home. From the designer David Green: \"I'm inspired by clean and simple design, utilizing only what is needed. I applied this thinking to the design of UDRY. It is light, compact, easy to use, easy to clean, and highly functional. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V35CsPcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B091BHG38K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BHG38K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BHG38K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
