window.products.push({"id":940191,"name":"Meteou Acrylic Stands for Display Perfume Display Stand Cologne Organizer Dessert Stand Cupcake Risers Display 3 Tier Display Stand Shelf for Amiibo P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKU6hUe+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY & STURDY DESIGN - Our 3 tier display stand are made of high-quality Acrylic panel with 4mm thickness, supported by two 12mm thick rectangular steps adds great durability & stability, with polished edges, no cheap plastic. Therefore Meteou Acrylic riser stand shelf is more solid and stable, stronger support, no discoloration, not easy to break. SUPPORT LEGS ARE WITH UNIBODY DESIGN, EASY TO INSTALL - Compared to other display stands on the market, they have too many supporting legs and you will spend a lot of time screwing to complete the installation. We designed the one-piece leg for this purpose. At the same time, the package comes with a screwdriver and instruction. Just tighten two supporting legs with the packed screws & screwdriver. This process will save you a lot of time. PERFECT PERFUME ORGANIZER & CUPCAKE STAND - Our Acrylic display shelf is 11.8 inch long and 3.5 inch wide, which fits most perfume and dessert cakes on the market, which can make their arrangement look more organized and attract people at a glance. WIDELY USED - Acrylic tiered display stand make efficient use of your counter space. This display stand is an great ideal for displaying toy figurines in cabinets, celebrating party desserts and displaying cosmetics on the dresser. The display shelf help to create an eye catching feature of your items, such as perfume collections, cupcake, nail polish, spice, seasoning and more. WELL PACKAGED AND FRIENDLY CUSTOMER SERVICE - All Acrylic Display Stands are wrapped in a protective bubble film to prevent this Perfume Organizer Cupcake Stand Display Shelf from scratching and damage. If you encounter any problems when use this product or have any suggestions for improving the product, please don't worry and contact us by mail, we are responsible for quality problems. Every METEOU product comes with 1 YEAR manufacturer warranty and 24 HOURS customer service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKU6hUe+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meteou","source_asin":"B0BJTV57VW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJTV57VW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJTV57VW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
