window.products.push({"id":940226,"name":"efo Lemon Squeezer Reamer - Citrus Squeezer - Good Grips Wooden Reamer - Orange Juice Squeezer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PCftJNKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why so many people choose efo Wooden Juice Extractor? SIMPLE and EFFECTIVE Sometimes the simplest tools are the best for the job. Efo Wooden Citrus Reamer, there are no gimmicks – just a simple but extremely effective tool for juicing lemons, limes, oranges, and other citrus fruits or even some vegetables like tomatoes. You can’t go wrong with this reamer. It boasts a simple design that meets the highest quality standards. To extract the most juice first slice the lemon in half, then simply poke the flesh of the fruit with the reaming end until all the juice flows down into a container below. You will be truly amazed at how easy it is to use this professional lemon squeezer. Why bother dragging the bulky electric juicer from the cupboard when you only need a glass or a couple of tablespoons of juice? With efo Wooden Juice Reamer you can do it quicker and simpler. This makes it a great choice for baking, cooking, cocktail making, and other situations where you don’t need a whole jugful of juice. QUALITY and ECO FRIENDLY Choose biodegradable eco-friendly efo Wooden Lemon Reamer. Our hand juicer squeezer is crafted from sustainably sourced beech wood. We only use wood from old beechwood trees that have come to the end of their natural life and have already been replaced with younger trees. This wood is sturdy, easy to clean, and unbreakable. In addition, with our eco reamer, you don't have to worry about electricity or batteries. EASY TO CLEAN Our Lime Juicer Squeezer can be easily cleaned under warm soapy water. Please do not place them in a dishwasher as they don't like it. 100% ecologic, clear wood (FSC certificate). Impregnate with cooking oil before the first use. To avoid deformation of the wooden tools, do not leave exposed to heat or sunshine or soak in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PCftJNKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFO","source_asin":"B00LH4PD32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LH4PD32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LH4PD32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
