window.products.push({"id":940487,"name":"Peaceful Classics Wood Rustic Floating Shelf - Wall Mounted Shelf with Iron Brackets, Shelves for Wall Decor, Renter Friendly Shelves on Bathroom, Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":154.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MSpey3qFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN YET RUSTIC: This Peaceful Classics floating shelf with dimensions of 8\" D x 10.25\" H x 48\" L has wall mounts and screws to set up your floating wall shelf anywhere in your home. You can use it as a hanging bookshelf, plant wall shelf, bathroom wall decor, bedroom shelves, kitchen wall shelf, or storage shelf ideal for small spaces. MULTI-USE: This rustic hanging wall shelf can be used to display your picture frames, houseplants, and other decorative items. You can also utilize this floating shelf to store spices in the kitchen, toiletries in the bathroom, or books in the bedroom. WELL-BUILT & DURABLE: The Peaceful Classics floating shelf is neither fragile nor breakable. This wall shelf is crafted with solid pine wood and made to last longer. It has the strength to hold household items, books on the wall, game room accents, shelves for the bedroom, and wall shelves in the living room to give more space and design to your house. EASY TO INSTALL WALL MOUNTED SHELF: The package includes instructions for setting up your rustic wood floating shelf, making installation easier. Wall brackets and all hardware are included for easy mounting, so you can enjoy looking at your new rustic wood shelves. TIMELESS VALUE OF AMISH CRAFTMANSHIP: At Peaceful Classics, we aim to bring Amish craftsmanship's beauty and impeccable value to your home and introduce the country's finest US-made furniture. These are handcrafted in Lancaster by Amish craftsmen who are among the most incredible people you'll encounter. Their names might not be plastered on the floating shelves, but each artisan has a story built into each piece that will complement your rustic home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MSpey3qFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peaceful Classics","source_asin":"B0BL4S7652","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL4S7652","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL4S7652","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
