window.products.push({"id":940841,"name":"TBWHL Wok Slotted Spatula Wide Spatula Slotted Turner Stainless Steel Heavy Duty for Cooking Baking Flipping Grilling Frying Pancake Spatula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RWUQzA2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: Made from the highest-quality thickened 304 stainless steel to ensure long-lasting use and a clean, attractive finish.This Stainless Steel wont dent, crack, rust, or chip. BEAUTIFUL: Mirrored Finish, and Sleek Seamless Design USE CONVENIENTLY AND COMFORTABLE : The slotted turner allows liquids to drain while turning fish. It aslo can stop messy oil spills and drips. This thin and flexible edge helps slide beneath food with ease - beveled shape won't let food easily slide off! EASY STORAGE: Small Hole in the Handle to Hang on a Hook. Length: 15 Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RWUQzA2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TBWHL","source_asin":"B083KBJG9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083KBJG9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083KBJG9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":940842,"name":"Command Jumbo Plastic Hook with Adhesive Strips 1 ea (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pz0A-zkGL._AC_SL1469_.jpg","description":"Life is easier when everything has its place. Organize your home damage-free with Command Utility Hooks. Command Hooks let you hang what you want, where you want, without the hassle of tools and nails. Command Strips hold strongly on a variety of smooth, finished surfaces, and these adhesive hooks remove cleanly with no sticky residue or damage left behind. Now you can organize your home or office just the way you want with Command Utility Hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pz0A-zkGL._AC_SL1469_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3M Commercial Office Supply Div.","source_asin":"B002ZZ3HUI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002ZZ3HUI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002ZZ3HUI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":940843,"name":"Kate and Laurel Travis Modern Capsule Wood Framed Wall Mirror, 12 x 24, Gold, Chic Geometric Wall Hanging Mirror for Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V3Onvz3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Travis collection of sophisticated wall mirrors offers your home a new take on modern simplicity. Inspired by the bold geometry of contemporary design, the Travis wall mirror features a capsule-like, oval shape, produced with clean, sophisticated lines that arch at both ends. It's constructed with a sturdy, yet resilient, wooden material, with a lovely gold finish for the ultimate statement piece. The overall dimensions of this wall mirror are 12 inches wide by 24 inches high, making it the perfect size to stand out in multiples of two or three in a beautiful space. Or you can also hang it on its own to create an elegant focal point in any modern living room, entryway, or dining room. The Travis mirror also makes for a great bathroom mirror above a vanity or sink. Hanging a wall mirror expands your space by spreading light, thereby creating a more open, dimensional look. The Travis capsule mirror hangs both vertically and horizontally on your wall to blend into your decor seamlessly. Plus, it hangs in seconds with easy-to-use metal D-ring hangers attached to the back of the frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V3Onvz3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B08CWH3PNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CWH3PNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CWH3PNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":940844,"name":"PROMEED 100% Silk King Fitted Sheet Only with 16\" Extra Deep Pocket, Top Grade 6A 22 Momme Mulberry Silk Bed Bottom Sheet 1pc (White, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":274.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o96Ybw4IL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Mulberry Silk ✅Keep Skin Moisturised: Made with tightly-woven, smooth fibres, the properties of silk allow it to keep moisture close to the skin, so you’re not losing that well needed hydration sleeping in silk bedding as you would by sleeping on cotton. This also brings it back to reversing the signs of ageing – happy, hydrated and plumper skin means less wrinkles! ✅Relieve Skin Conditions: If you suffer from eczema, or some other skin conditions, a silk fitted sheet isn’t going to stop the situation, but it will minimize the problem by making for a healthier, cleaner sleeping environment, and is a much better option than cotton. Silk is a natural fibre that does not clog pores, it won’t absorb moisture or products – making it healthy for the skin in general. ✅Regulates Temperature: Silk is a lightweight and breathable material that is a natural heat regulator, meaning that sleeping on silk pillowcases or sheets is not only comfortable but cooler, too. Its ability to maintain a cool and consistent temperature throughout the night can help to reduce excessive sweating and therefore slow down the unwanted hot flushes. ✅Improve Sleep: 30 to 40 percent of Americans have problems sleeping, bedding may be at least partly to blame in some of these cases. Sheets that irritate your skin, or bunch up, will interfere with a good night’s rest. Silk, with all its aforementioned benefits, is the fabric that will dress your bed for the sweetest possible slumber. ✅Easy Care: Hand wash recommended, machine washable at gentle circle. Promeed 3rd Generation Silk bedding are more durable than common silk or satin products and remain smooth to the touch after many washes. Remember to use ph-neutral liquid detergent and NEVER dry detergent. Detailed care instructions are included in the package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o96Ybw4IL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROMEED","source_asin":"B0BZLCJFQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZLCJFQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZLCJFQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
