window.products.push({"id":940898,"name":"Erazor Bits Police Throw Blanket, Blue Lives Matter Blanket, Duty, Honor and Courage Cozy Fleece Bed Spread for Cops THF2293-TB (50 x 60 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avgCHarGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Police blankets are made of super soft 100% polyester fleece. They are crafted with top quality fabric and tailored to last a lifetime of cuddling. Our Police throw blankets are for everyone to enjoy the finest quality at an affordable price. The 100% polyester fabric that we use ensures optimal softness, warmth, and hassle-free maintenance. They are washer, dryer, indoor and outdoor safe. Our blanket throws are durable and lightweight! They are warm enough for an emergency blanket by a winter campfire and light enough to use as a summer picnic blanket. There are so many reasons to purchase our fleece Police throws. They are great in any scenario. Since they are lightweight, they can easily fit into a tote bag for traveling in cars or airplanes. They are really useful for outdoor events and sports games. The Police logos on our American throw blankets are eye-catching and show your appreciation for the servicemen and women of our country.  In addition to being great on-the-go, our American blankets look great in any home. Fleece throw blankets add a finished and cozy look to any room. As an extra layer of texture and color, they look great thrown on a chair, couch, bed, or any way you can get creative. Interior designers always make use of soft fabrics such as throws to make a room inviting and stylish. You can put one in each room because you and your guests will love being able to grab one whenever you wish to get more comfortable!  The Police fleece blankets are great for adults and kids too. Police baby blankets and Police receiving blankets make great gifts for parents related to or proud of Policemen. When special occasions like Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, Housewarming or Retirement parties have you overwhelmed, our blankets should be your go-to gift. They compliment any home and are always useful. A law enforcement gift for women or men is always an appropriate way to show your pride and support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avgCHarGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erazor Bits","source_asin":"B07876P5TD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07876P5TD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07876P5TD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
