window.products.push({"id":940917,"name":"KATHSI Cold Brew Coffee Maker, 51 OZ Iced Coffee Maker and Tea Brewer, Heavy-Duty Large Capacity with Deluxe Stainless Steel Filter,1.6 Quart, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TiOqbMl3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Cold Brew Pitcher】- this cold brew maker the top seals well and the filter sits inside the cap with its own cover so grounds don’t slip into your coffee. It’s easy to dissemble and clean .Cold brew coffee is less acidic & doesn't bother your stomach. With this coffee maker there are no grounds in the coffee (unlike the press-style one ). It's easy to make great-tasting iced coffee. 【Super Easy to Use 】--- KATHSI cold brew iced coffee maker is easy to use & clean, plus save money since you're not going out to buy coffee everyday! Materials: a heavy glass container, solid plastic that feels sturdy and long lasting, and a fine stainless steel strainer . it can take a beating in cleaning without bending or folding. If you want to experiment with a cold brew coffee maker that won't break the bank and delivers great cold brew, KATHSI ice coffee maker will be a good choice. 【Cold Brew Coffee at Home】 --- Summertime must -cold brew pitcher is good size and easy to use and the cold brew taste amazing. avid cold brew drinkers If you like strong cold coffee this is a must have. Cold brew, more flavor, hydration, and 70% less acidic than hot coffee on average. Helps you get your caffeine without ruining your teeth and upsetting your stomach plus it’s tastier and refreshing! Makes a nice, smooth cold brew every day that can be mixed in a multitude of ways. 【Conveniences & Endless Possibilities】 ---Maybe you always want the easy availability of coffee at home, and in your hectic mornings it can be quite difficult to try fit everything in you want/need before leaving for work. With the simplicity and convenience of the cold brewer, coffee in the morning became as easy as popping the top and pouring a cup of joe to get you started on your way out the door. Reusable for Iced Tea, Wine, Juice, and others. 【Make your own cold brew coffee】 ---Makes a solid 5/6 generous cups of cold brew at a time . put your fresh grinds in the container first then pour water over the grinds and fill the pitcher. Pop in the fridge overnight or up to 24 hrs (depending on your desired strength) for a stronger brew and you will get clean, amazing life juice in the desired grounds of your choice. KATHSI iced coffee maker is like a cold espresso carafe. This is the coffee maybe your coworkers would pay you to bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TiOqbMl3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KATHSI","source_asin":"B0BTYMBS7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-940917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYMBS7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYMBS7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
